---
/**
 * Inline Material Symbols.
 *
 * The page only needs a handful of icons, but the Google Material Symbols
 * webfont weighs ~1.1 MB and blocks rendering. These paths are copied from
 * google/material-design-icons (Apache-2.0) so each icon costs a few hundred
 * bytes of markup and nothing else.
